# The game flow check (tests/battle3d/run.sh) since slice 3D-5: the Warden appears once Wren gives her token,
# so the route is Wren (accept), the north-west patrol, the road patrol, Wren (the report), Brom (potions, then a
# rest and the refill: the Warden is not winnable without potions, docs/NEXT_SLICE_DIALOG.md finding 5), the Warden.
choose 0
talk wren
chase slime_a
chase slime_b
talk wren
talk brom
choose 0
talk brom
policy boss:good:1
chase warden
